title: DPsim
message: If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the software paper.
type: software
authors:
  - name: The DPsim Authors
repository-code: https://github.com/sogno-platform/dpsim
url: https://sogno.energy/dpsim/
abstract: >-
  DPsim is a solver library for dynamic power system simulation. It supports the
  electromagnetic transient and dynamic phasor domains as well as continuous
  power flow, and is capable of real-time execution.
license: MPL-2.0
